#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Description of Grover's algorithm {#description-of-grovers-algorithm}"
msgstr "Penerangan algoritma Grover {#description-of-grovers-algorithm}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we'll describe Grover's algorithm.\n"
"We'll begin by discussing *phase query gates* and how to build them, followed by the description of Grover's algorithm itself.\n"
"Finally, we'll briefly discuss how this algorithm is naturally applied to searching.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam bahagian ini, kita akan menerangkan algoritma Grover.\n"
"Kita akan mulakan dengan membincangkan *gate pertanyaan fasa* dan cara membinanya, diikuti dengan penerangan algoritma Grover itu sendiri.\n"
"Akhirnya, kita akan membincangkan secara ringkas bagaimana algoritma ini secara semulajadi digunakan untuk pencarian.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Phase query gates {#phase-query-gates}"
msgstr "gate pertanyaan fasa {#phase-query-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grover's algorithm makes use of operations known as *phase query gates*.\n"
"In contrast to an ordinary query gate $U_f,$ defined for a given function $f$ in the usual way described previously, a phase query gate for the function $f$ is defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma Grover menggunakan operasi yang dikenali sebagai *gate pertanyaan fasa*.\n"
"Berbeza dengan gate pertanyaan biasa $U_f,$ yang ditakrifkan untuk fungsi $f$ yang diberikan dengan cara biasa yang telah diterangkan sebelum ini, gate pertanyaan fasa untuk fungsi $f$ ditakrifkan sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_f \\vert x\\rangle = (-1)^{f(x)} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_f \\vert x\\rangle = (-1)^{f(x)} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"
msgstr "untuk setiap rentetan $x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The operation $Z_f$ can be implemented using one query gate $U_f$ as this "
"diagram suggests:\n"
msgstr ""
"Operasi $Z_f$ boleh dilaksanakan menggunakan satu gate pertanyaan $U_f$ "
"seperti yang dicadangkan oleh rajah ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A quantum circuit implementing a Z_f gate using one query gate together "
"with the phase kickback phenomenon](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Z_f.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Litar kuantum yang melaksanakan gate Z_f menggunakan satu gate pertanyaan "
"bersama fenomena tendangan fasa](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-"
"quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Z_f.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implementation makes use of the phase kickback phenomenon, and requires that one workspace qubit, initialized to a $\\vert -\\rangle$ state, is made available.\n"
"This qubit remains in the $\\vert - \\rangle$ state after the implementation has completed, and can be reused (to implement subsequent $Z_f$ gates, for instance) or simply discarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelaksanaan ini menggunakan fenomena tendangan fasa, dan memerlukan satu qubit ruang kerja yang diinisialisasi kepada keadaan $\\vert -\\rangle$ tersedia.\n"
"Qubit ini kekal dalam keadaan $\\vert - \\rangle$ selepas pelaksanaan selesai, dan boleh digunakan semula (untuk melaksanakan gate $Z_f$ berikutnya, misalnya) atau hanya dibuang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to the operation $Z_f,$ we will also make use of a phase query "
"gate for the $n$-bit OR function, which is defined as follows for each "
"string $x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain operasi $Z_f,$ kita juga akan menggunakan gate pertanyaan fasa untuk "
"fungsi OR $n$-bit, yang ditakrifkan seperti berikut untuk setiap rentetan "
"$x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{OR}(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"  0 & x = 0^n\\\\[0.5mm]\n"
"  1 & x \\neq 0^n\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{OR}(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"  0 & x = 0^n\\\\[0.5mm]\n"
"  1 & x \\neq 0^n\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explicitly, the phase query gate for the $n$-bit OR function operates like "
"this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara eksplisit, gate pertanyaan fasa untuk fungsi OR $n$-bit beroperasi "
"seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"  \\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[0.5mm]\n"
"- \\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"  \\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[0.5mm]\n"
"- \\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be clear, this is how $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ operates on standard basis "
"states; its behavior on arbitrary states is determined from this expression "
"by linearity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk jelaskan, inilah cara $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ beroperasi pada keadaan asas "
"standard; tingkah lakunya pada keadaan sewenang-wenangnya ditentukan "
"daripada ungkapan ini melalui kelelurusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ can be implemented as a quantum circuit by beginning with a Boolean circuit for the OR function, then constructing a $U_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ operation (that is, a standard query gate for the $n$-bit OR function) using the procedure described in the *Quantum algorithmic foundations* lesson, and finally a $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ operation using the phase kickback phenomenon as described above.\n"
"Notice that the operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ has no dependence on the function $f$ and can therefore be implemented by a quantum circuit having no query gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Operasi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ boleh dilaksanakan sebagai litar kuantum dengan memulakan dengan litar Boolean untuk fungsi OR, kemudian membina operasi $U_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ (iaitu gate pertanyaan standard untuk fungsi OR $n$-bit) menggunakan prosedur yang diterangkan dalam pelajaran *Asas algoritmik kuantum*, dan akhirnya operasi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ menggunakan fenomena tendangan fasa seperti yang diterangkan di atas.\n"
"Perhatikan bahawa operasi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ tidak bergantung pada fungsi $f$ dan oleh itu boleh dilaksanakan oleh litar kuantum tanpa gate pertanyaan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Description of the algorithm {#description-of-the-algorithm}"
msgstr "Penerangan algoritma {#description-of-the-algorithm}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that we have the two operations $Z_f$ and $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}},$ we can "
"describe Grover's algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita sudah mempunyai kedua-dua operasi $Z_f$ dan "
"$Z_{\\mathrm{OR}},$ kita boleh menerangkan algoritma Grover.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The algorithm refers to a number $t,$ which is the number of *iterations* it performs (and therefore the number of *queries* to the function $f$ it requires).\n"
"This number $t$ isn't specified by Grover's algorithm as we're describing it, and we'll discuss later in the lesson how it can be chosen.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma ini merujuk kepada nombor $t,$ iaitu bilangan *lelaran* yang dilakukan (dan oleh itu bilangan *pertanyaan* kepada fungsi $f$ yang diperlukan).\n"
"Nombor $t$ ini tidak ditetapkan oleh algoritma Grover seperti yang kita terangkan di sini, dan kita akan membincangkan kemudian dalam pelajaran ini bagaimana ia boleh dipilih.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Grover's algorithm\">\n"
"1. Initialize an $n$ qubit register $\\mathsf{Q}$ to the all-zero state $\\vert 0^n \\rangle$ and then apply a Hadamard operation to each qubit of $\\mathsf{Q}.$\n"
"2. Apply $t$ times the unitary operation $G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f$ to the register $\\mathsf{Q}$\n"
"3. Measure the qubits of $\\mathsf{Q}$ with respect to standard basis measurements and output the resulting string.\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"Algoritma Grover\">\n"
"1. Inisialisasi daftar $n$ qubit $\\mathsf{Q}$ kepada keadaan semua-sifar $\\vert 0^n \\rangle$ kemudian gunakan operasi Hadamard pada setiap qubit dalam $\\mathsf{Q}.$\n"
"2. Gunakan $t$ kali operasi uniter $G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f$ pada daftar $\\mathsf{Q}$\n"
"3. Ukur qubit dalam $\\mathsf{Q}$ berkenaan dengan pengukuran asas standard dan keluarkan rentetan yang terhasil.\n"
"</Figure>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The operation $G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f$ iterated in step 2 will be called the *Grover operation* throughout the remainder of this lesson.\n"
"Here is a quantum circuit representation of the Grover operation when $n=7\\!:$\n"
msgstr ""
"Operasi $G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f$ yang diulang dalam langkah 2 akan dipanggil *operasi Grover* sepanjang baki pelajaran ini.\n"
"Berikut ialah representasi litar kuantum bagi operasi Grover apabila $n=7\\!:$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A quantum circuit representation of the Grover "
"operation](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-"
"algorithms/grover-algorithm/Grover_operation.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Representasi litar kuantum bagi operasi "
"Grover](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_operation.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this diagram, the $Z_f$ operation is depicted as being larger than $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ as an informal visual clue to suggest that it is likely to be the more costly operation.\n"
"In particular, when we're working within the query model, $Z_f$ requires one query while $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ requires no queries.\n"
"If instead we have a Boolean circuit for the function $f,$ and then convert it to a quantum circuit for $Z_f,$ we can reasonably expect that the resulting quantum circuit will be larger and more complicated than one for $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam rajah ini, operasi $Z_f$ digambarkan lebih besar daripada $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ sebagai petunjuk visual tidak formal untuk mencadangkan bahawa ia kemungkinan besar merupakan operasi yang lebih mahal.\n"
"Khususnya, apabila kita bekerja dalam model pertanyaan, $Z_f$ memerlukan satu pertanyaan manakala $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ tidak memerlukan sebarang pertanyaan.\n"
"Sebaliknya, jika kita mempunyai litar Boolean untuk fungsi $f,$ dan kemudian menukarnya kepada litar kuantum untuk $Z_f,$ kita boleh menjangka bahawa litar kuantum yang terhasil akan lebih besar dan lebih rumit berbanding litar untuk $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here's a diagram of a quantum circuit for the entire algorithm when $n=7$ and $t=3.$\n"
"For larger values of $t$ we can simply insert additional instances of the Grover operation immediately before the measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut ialah rajah litar kuantum untuk keseluruhan algoritma apabila $n=7$ dan $t=3.$\n"
"Untuk nilai $t$ yang lebih besar, kita boleh memasukkan contoh tambahan operasi Grover tepat sebelum pengukuran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A quantum circuit for Grover's algorithm when "
"t=3](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_circuit.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Litar kuantum untuk algoritma Grover apabila "
"t=3](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_circuit.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Application to search {#application-to-search}"
msgstr "Aplikasi untuk pencarian {#application-to-search}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Grover's algorithm can be applied to the *Search* problem as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma Grover boleh digunakan untuk masalah *Carian* seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose the number $t$ in step 2. (This is discussed later in the lesson.)\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih nombor $t$ dalam langkah 2. (Ini dibincangkan kemudian dalam "
"pelajaran.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run Grover's algorithm on the function $f,$ using whatever choice we made "
"for $t,$ to obtain a string $x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan algoritma Grover pada fungsi $f,$ menggunakan pilihan yang kita "
"buat untuk $t,$ untuk mendapatkan rentetan $x\\in\\Sigma^n.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Query the function $f$ on the string $x$ to see if it's a valid solution:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tanya fungsi $f$ pada rentetan $x$ untuk melihat sama ada ia adalah "
"penyelesaian yang sah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $f(x) = 1,$ then we have found a solution, so we can stop and output "
"$x.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika $f(x) = 1,$ maka kita telah menemui penyelesaian, jadi kita boleh "
"berhenti dan mengeluarkan $x.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if $f(x) = 0,$ then we can either run the procedure again, "
"possibly with a different choice for $t,$ or we can decide to give up and "
"output \"no solution.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika tidak, jika $f(x) = 0,$ maka kita boleh sama ada menjalankan prosedur "
"sekali lagi, mungkin dengan pilihan yang berbeza untuk $t,$ atau kita boleh "
"memutuskan untuk berhenti dan mengeluarkan \"tiada penyelesaian.\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once we've analyzed how Grover's algorithm works, we'll see that by taking "
"$t = O(\\sqrt{N}),$ we obtain a solution to our search problem (if one "
"exists) with high probability.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah kita menganalisis cara algoritma Grover berfungsi, kita akan lihat "
"bahawa dengan mengambil $t = O(\\sqrt{N}),$ kita mendapat penyelesaian "
"kepada masalah pencarian kita (jika ada) dengan kebarangkalian yang "
"tinggi.\n"
